    "description": {
      "value": "This tattoo is a series of six concentric circles that show up as a soft yellow on any skin tone. The marks carry in them a protective force that bolsters your body and soul. The first time each day that someone attempts to Treat your Wounds and rolls a critical failure, they get a failure instead.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nFor 5 rounds, your entire body begins to glow, with the effects of a 1st-level light spell. At the end of each of your turns during this time, you regain 1d4 Hit Points."
